# The partner repositories molvis's Python package is built against, checked
# out next to this repository (../molrs, ../molpy) by
# MolCrafts/molcrafts-ci/actions/setup-partners in every workflow that resolves
# python/ (lint, test, docs). python/pyproject.toml builds them from those
# checkouts ([tool.uv.sources]).
#
# KEY=VALUE lines only. On dev, partners are tracked, not pinned: <NAME>_REF=dev
# is the partner's dev tip -- or its branch named like the one being built,
# when the partner has one (a change spanning both repositories). A release
# commit on master names the partners' release tags instead.
#
# python/uv.lock records the partners' package metadata (version and
# dependencies), not a commit. When a partner's dev changes that metadata,
# `uv lock --check` fails; relock in a commit of its own.
#
# The npm side is not tracked here: the TypeScript packages build against the
# published @molcrafts/molrs (core/package.json).
SELF=molvis
MOLRS_REPOSITORY=MolCrafts/molrs
MOLRS_REF=dev
MOLPY_REPOSITORY=MolCrafts/molpy
MOLPY_REF=dev
